","original_name":"Beverly Hills, 90210","overview":"Follow the lives of a group of teenagers living in the upscale, star-studded community of Beverly Hills, California and attending the fictitious West Beverly Hills High School and, subsequently, the fictitious California University after graduation.","popularity":694.6354,"poster_path":"/b7BYfkhu653D894krwGO1ysIKTf.jpg","first_air_date":"1990-10-04","softcore":false,"name":"Beverly Hills, 90210","vote_average":7.26,"vote_count":868},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/2UElp7Dkm3SiB9ZEdKEWNmAOijB.jpg","genre_ids":[10759,16,35,10765,10751],"id":61923,"origin_country":["US"],"original_language":"en","original_name":"Star vs. the Forces of Evil","overview":"Intergalactic warrior Star Butterfly arrives on Earth to live with the Diaz family. She continues to battle villains throughout the universe and high school, mainly to protect her extremely powerful wand, an object that still confuses her.","popularity":593.6217,"poster_path":"/dKFL1AOdKNoazqZDg1zq2z69Lx1.jpg","first_air_date":"2015-01-18","softcore":false,"name":"Star vs. the Forces of Evil","vote_average":8.4,"vote_count":1542},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/lnVWmFvLv2pTZGsuAJytiqKu541.jpg","genre_ids":[18,9648],"id":253376,"origin_country":["US","GB"],"original_language":"en","original_name":"The Girlfriend","overview":"Laura has it all: a glittering career, a loving husband, and her precious son, Daniel. But her perfect life unravels when Daniel brings home Cherry, a girlfriend who changes everything. After a tense introduction, Laura becomes convinced Cherry is hiding something. Is she a manipulative social climber, or is Laura just paranoid? The truth is a matter of perspective.","popularity":579.0927,"poster_path":"/ktrp3tdZ5IQpFux4nLy8z70bt3n.jpg","first_air_date":"2025-09-10","softcore":false,"name":"The Girlfriend","vote_average":7.142,"vote_count":169},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/5G4Bnc4Q0YUK1bwLEUYmIsmm2Ib.jpg","genre_ids":[18,9648,10765],"id":1413,