ry":["JP"],"original_language":"ja","original_name":"ポケットモンスター","overview":"Join Ash accompanied by his partner Pikachu, as he travels through many regions, meets new friends and faces new challenges on his quest to become a Pokémon Master.","popularity":474.6696,"poster_path":"/lP4zwr0F7hWTbAFltfoFTc2AxRG.jpg","first_air_date":"1997-04-01","softcore":false,"name":"Pokémon","vote_average":7.988,"vote_count":2308},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/2rmK7mnchw9Xr3XdiTFSxTTLXqv.jpg","genre_ids":[10759,35,16],"id":37854,"origin_country":["JP"],"original_language":"ja","original_name":"ワンピース","overview":"Years ago, the fearsome Pirate King, Gol D. Roger was executed leaving a huge pile of treasure and the famous \"One Piece\" behind. Whoever claims the \"One Piece\" will be named the new King of the Pirates.\n\nMonkey D. Luffy, a boy who consumed a \"Devil Fruit,\" decides to follow in the footsteps of his idol, the pirate Shanks, and find the One Piece. It helps, of course, that his body has the properties of rubber and that he's surrounded by a bevy of skilled fighters and thieves to help him along the way.\n\nLuffy will do anything to get the One Piece and become King of the Pirates!","popularity":365.4517,"poster_path":"/dB4EDhre2dsC2kxYDavyKWqLQwi.jpg","first_air_date":"1999-10-20","softcore":false,"name":"One Piece","vote_average":8.8,"vote_count":5650},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/c2oiRa7V3bQzof4wVGzLXtWJ5QU.jpg","genre_ids":[10759,16,35,10765,10762,10751],"id":65733,"origin_country":["JP"],"original_language":"ja","original_name":"ドラえもん","overview":"Robotic cat Doraemon is sent back in time from the 22nd century to protect 10-year-old Noby, a lazy and uncoordinated boy who is destined to have a tragic future. Doraemon can create secret gadgets from a pocket on his stomach, but they usually cause more bad than good because of Noby's propensity to misuse them.","popularity":309.0494,"poster_path":"/9ZN1P32SHviL3SV51qLivxycvcx.jpg","first_air_date":"2005-04-22","softcore":false,"name":"Doraemon","vote_average":8.094,"vote_count":262},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/vuajwjep1FxphPhMEWKv4bfrCnf.jpg","genre_ids":[16,35],"id":57775,"origin_country":["JP"],"original_language":"ja","original_name":"ちびまる子ちゃん","overview":"Meet Maruko, a sweet schoolgirl with a hefty dose of curiosity (and occasional laziness!). She sails through life in a cozy town alongside her loving parents, grandparents, and sister. Maruko has a band of loyal friends, including her closest pal, Tama-chan, but her playful and doting grandpa is at the heart of it all. Life is never dull in this charming series.","popularity":164.9068,"poster_path":"/bfn54AAMuh47IFqeoco0jgeVH1a.jpg","first_air_date":"1990-01-07","softcore":false,"name":"Chibi Maruko-chan","vote_average":7.8,"vote_count":25},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/z67lpMtm8YGykJO4p89meuNMvj8.jpg","genre_ids":[16,80,9648,35],"id":30983,"origin_country":["JP"],"original_language":"ja","original_name":"名探偵コナン","overview":"The son of a world famous mystery writer, Jimmy Kudo, has achieved his own notoriety by assisting the local police as a student detective. He has always been able to solve the most difficult of criminal cases using his wits and power of reason.","popularity":156.6036,"poster_path":"/iHfA63x7rFaWbP2C832uCe2r0zy.jpg","first_air_date":"1996-01-08","softcore":false,"name":"Detective Conan","vote_average":8,"vote_count":801},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/o0NsbcIvsllg6CJX0FBFY8wWbsn.jpg","genre_ids":[10759,16,10765],"id":30984,"origin_country":["JP"],"original_language":"ja","original_name":"BLEACH","overview":"For as long as he can remember, Ichigo Kurosaki has been able to see ghosts. But when he meets Rukia, a Soul Reaper who battles evil spirits known as Hollows, he finds his life is changed forever. Now, with a newfound wealth of spiritual energy, Ichigo discovers his true calling: to protect the living and the dead from evil.","popularity":124.4779,"poster_path":"/2EewmxXe72ogD0EaWM8gqa0ccIw.jpg","first_air_date":"2004-10-05","softcore":false,"name":"Bleach","vote_average":8.351,"vote_count":2342},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/4fVwc77cov2q9i0szzYhlkAaqza.jpg","genre_ids":[35,10759,10762,16,10751],"id":34860,"origin_country":["JP"],"original_language":"ja","original_name":"忍たま乱太郎","overview":"Rantarō, Shinbei and Kirimaru are ninja  apprentices in the Ninja Gakuen, where first grade ones are called  \"Nintamas\". They must learn  everything a ninja must know, but as for our heroes, money, food or  playing are more interesting. The series show the everyday adventures of  our heroes.","popularity":114.3581,"poster_path":"/fzNiSp0HhCthOTYu9IYWlPPa7fU.jpg","first_air_date":"1993-04-10","softcore":false,"name":"Ninja Boy Rantaro","vote_average":6.86,"vote_count":25},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/6oVBODwFvbDJczBFlf4J930jKZg.jpg","genre_ids":[10759,16,35,10765,10762,10751],"id":57911,"origin_country":["JP"],"original_language":"ja","original_name":"ドラえもん","overview":"Doraemon is an anime TV series created by Fujiko F. Fujio and based on the manga series of the same name. This anime is the much more successful successor of the 1973 anime.","popularity":110.32,"poster_path":"/bHMqPDsW7Lb71CVHXq4PuEvQ4NY.jpg","first_air_date":"1979-04-02","softcore":false,"name":"Doraemon","vote_average":7.7,"vote_count":624},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/j6jHIjnyCT5YwxEKu7c8e7DS57V.jpg","genre_ids":[16,35],"id":9537,"origin_country":["JP"],"original_language":"ja","original_name":"あたしンち","overview":"A light hearted comedy based on the about the daily life of a \"normal\" Japanese family. The Tachibana family consists of a housewife mom, a salary-man dad, and teenager Mikan and Yuzuhiko.","popularity":90.5677,"poster_path":"/bQCZvbyTJFWt3majCn37ykJBpIf.jpg","first_air_date":"2002-04-19","softcore":false,"name":"Atashin'chi","vote_average":8.4,"vote_count":15},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/8phLVFEXOe02JgFmH9ldn3j4tXW.jpg","genre_ids":[16,10759,10765],"id":312359,"origin_country":["JP"],"original_language":"ja","original_name":"ドラゴンボール超 ビルス","overview":"When Beerus, the God of Destruction, awakens in search of a worthy rival, Goku and his friends face an epic battle to stop him from destroying Earth.\n\nRemastered and re-edited version of Dragon Ball Super.","popularity":86.583,"poster_path":"/AojgldgsOlzZV8ahyOzaiAjJWvV.jpg","first_air_date":"2026-10-11","softcore":false,"name":"Dragon Ball Super: Beerus","vote_average":9.629,"vote_count":415},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/ydf1CeiBLfdxiyNTpskM0802TKl.jpg","genre_ids":[16,10765,10759],"id":12971,"origin_country":["JP"],"original_language":"ja","original_name":"ドラゴンボールゼット","overview":"Now happily married and with a son, martial arts champion Goku must defend Earth from a series of extraterrestrial invaders bent on destruction.","popularity":86.0601,"poster_path":"/oQ5CnVj3TRifXl2bIOri6H6rfNe.jpg","first_air_date":"1989-04-26","softcore":false,"name":"Dragon Ball Z","vote_average":8.4,"vote_count":5079},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/l2gc2dPRUPe3bAfYCRTjc6uAMmB.jpg","genre_ids":[16,10759,10765],"id":45790,"origin_country":["JP"],"original_language":"ja","original_name":"ジョジョの奇妙な冒険","overview":"Follow the intergenerational feud between the Joestar Family and various forces of evil, the most prominent of which is Dio Brando and his followers.","popularity":85.1428,"poster_path":"/ogAWwbh3frWtiTyyXrZaVFtqCgp.jpg","first_air_date":"2012-10-06","softcore":false,"name":"JoJo's Bizarre Adventure","vote_average":8.6,"vote_count":1710},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/z0YhJvomqedHF85bplUJEotkN5l.jpg","genre_ids":[16,10759,10765],"id":31910,"origin_country":["JP"],"original_language":"ja","original_name":"ナルト 疾風伝","overview":"After 2 and a half years Naruto finally returns to his village of Konoha, and sets about putting his ambitions to work. It will not be easy though as he has amassed a few more dangerous enemies, in the likes of the shinobi organization; Akatsuki.","popularity":82.006,"poster_path":"/kV27j3Nz4d5z8u6mN3EJw9RiLg2.jpg","first_air_date":"2007-02-15","softcore":false,"name":"Naruto Shippūden","vote_average":8.528,"vote_count":8855},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/flgn0jXbg8GIe2qaWfd70A0uzfp.jpg","genre_ids":[16,10765,10759],"id":95479,"origin_country":["JP"],"original_language":"ja","original_name":"呪術廻戦","overview":"Yuji Itadori is a boy with tremendous physical strength, though he lives a completely ordinary high school life. One day, to save a classmate who has been attacked by curses, he eats the finger of Ryomen Sukuna, taking the curse into his own soul. From then on, he shares one body with Ryomen Sukuna. Guided by the most powerful of sorcerers, Satoru Gojo, Itadori is admitted to Tokyo Jujutsu High School, an organization that fights the curses... and thus begins the heroic tale of a boy who became a curse to exorcise a curse, a life from which he could never turn back.","popularity":81.9653,"poster_path":"/6qQzMJG27XOJsyAEEIisoJB45j2.jpg","first_air_date":"2020-10-03","softcore":false,"name":"JUJUTSU KAISEN","vote_average":8.6,"vote_count":4744},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/5F0HVEgkgP99fEWDjPyikGt9jQi.jpg","genre_ids":[16,10759,10765],"id":46260,"origin_country":["JP"],"original_language":"ja","original_name":"ナルト","overview":"Naruto Uzumaki, a mischievous adolescent ninja, struggles as he searches for recognition and dreams of becoming the Hokage, the village's leader and strongest ninja.","popularity":76.6663,"poster_path":"/xppeysfvDKVx775MFuH8Z9BlpMk.jpg","first_air_date":"2002-10-03","softcore":false,"name":"Naruto","vote_average":8.4,"vote_count":6194},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/gffVOVZ2Y9cmVIZ26Gt9ByMGCYH.jpg","genre_ids":[16,9648,18],"id":220542,"origin_country":["JP"],"original_language":"ja","original_name":"薬屋のひとりごと","overview":"Maomao lived a peaceful life with her apothecary father. Until one day, she's sold as a lowly servant to the emperor's palace. But she wasn't meant for a compliant life among royalty. So when imperial heirs fall ill, she decides to step in and find a cure! This catches the eye of Jinshi, a handsome palace official who promotes her. Now, she's making a name for herself solving medical mysteries!","popularity":74.7851,"poster_path":"/sJZcy8QsOPuRPiCfoCWVB3r9Ohg.jpg","first_air_date":"2023-10-22","softcore":false,"name":"The Apothecary Diaries","vote_average":8.665,"vote_count":708},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/bFKKyCI89Xq98Gul8cGox8K3sZa.jpg","genre_ids":[16,10759,10765],"id":46298,"origin_country":["JP"],"original_language":"ja","original_name":"HUNTER×HUNTER","overview":"Gon, a young boy who lives on Whale Island, dreams of becoming a Hunter like his father, who left when Gon was still young.","popularity":71.3547,"poster_path":"/i2EEr2uBvRlAwJ8d8zTG2Y19mIa.jpg","first_air_date":"2011-10-02","softcore":false,"name":"Hunter x Hunter","vote_average":8.667,"vote_count":2270},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/7ZruEnSnHD6Jx5mF0hBt1E306Vt.jpg","genre_ids":[16,9648,10759,10765],"id":65942,"origin_country":["JP"],"original_language":"ja","original_name":"Re:ゼロから始める異世界生活","overview":"Natsuki Subaru, an ordinary high school  student, is on his way home from the convenience store when he finds  himself transported to another world. As he's lost and confused in a new  world where he doesn't even know left from right, the only person to  reach out to him was a beautiful girl with silver hair. Determined to  repay her somehow for saving him from his own despair, Subaru agrees to  help the girl find something she's looking for.","popularity":69.6046,"poster_path":"/oHqYrPAsIiTD5m4DuxumV4er8BU.jpg","first_air_date":"2016-04-04","softcore":false,"name":"Re:ZERO -Starting Life in Another World-","vote_average":8.1,"vote_count":822},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/zYIFOocMfsKAEysBjhZ8akfXFdB.jpg","genre_ids":[16,10759,80,18],"id":105009,"origin_country":["JP"],"original_language":"ja","original_name":"東京リベンジャーズ","overview":"Takemichi Hanagaki is a freelancer that’s reached the absolute pits of despair in his life. He finds out that the only girlfriend he ever had, in middle school, Hinata Tachibana, had been killed by the ruthless Tokyo Manji Gang. The day after hearing about her death, he’s standing on the station platform and ends up being pushed over onto the tracks by a herd of people. He closes his eyes thinking he’s about to die, but when he opens his eyes back up, he somehow had gone back in time 12 years. Now that he’s back living the best days of his life, Takemichi decides to get revenge on his life.","popularity":62.1123,"poster_path":"/arB3L9pZZBSzUPSC8BEv8c3X0bF.jpg","first_air_date":"2021-04-11","softcore":false,"name":"Tokyo Revengers","vote_average":8.407,"vote_count":1383},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/ecYulqPoYRFyttKyxaTpSEqDUbo.jpg","genre_ids":[16],"id":324301,"origin_country":["JP"],"original_language":"ja","original_name":"クレヨンしんちゃん","overview":"","popularity":60.1089,"poster_path":"/qTW3lU85NG83hXWtAdC3qwOgeDO.jpg","first_air_date":"1992-04-13","softcore":false,"name":"クレヨンしんちゃん","vote_average":9,"vote_count":1}],"viewAllHref":"/anime","defaultType":"tv"}],["$","$Le",null,{"title":"Cartoons & Animation","items":[{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/jIArNHIekrCSVgdMbKPAXpPY03Y.jpg","genre_ids":[16,35],"id":456,"origin_country":["US"],"original_language":"en","original_name":"The Simpsons","overview":"Set in Springfield, the average American town, the show focuses on the antics and everyday adventures of the Simpson family; Homer, Marge, Bart, Lisa and Maggie, as well as a virtual cast of thousands. Since the beginning, the series has been a pop culture icon, attracting hundreds of celebrities to guest star. The show has also made name for itself in its fearless satirical take on politics, media and American life in general.","popularity":1698.2059,"poster_path":"/tf0CUEynk6GfmrlHIQKQ5mfFP5P.jpg","first_air_date":"1989-12-17","softcore":false,"name":"The Simpsons","vote_average":8.028,"vot