p_path":"/6uVRPFflyJpo8Cx872olmlGTWla.jpg","genre_ids":[12,53],"id":1263337,"title":"Heart of the Beast","original_language":"en","original_title":"Heart of the Beast","overview":"After a harrowing plane crash, Special Forces officer James Belmont and his combat dog, Odin, find themselves stranded deep in the Alaskan wilderness. Together, they are forced into a brutal fight for survival against the elements.","popularity":540.2402,"poster_path":"/6sYemVUn79UPKz1ZsSG6kPU4RVy.jpg","release_date":"2026-09-19","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":7.563,"vote_count":759},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/j96rurZqmBjyY37Fncl3IB0qJNe.jpg","genre_ids":[878,9648,28],"id":1058424,"title":"Hope","original_language":"ko","original_title":"호프","overview":"In the remote South Korean village of Hope Harbor, police chief Bum-seok and officer Sung-ae are called to investigate a mysterious creature wreaking havoc on the community. But all is not as it seems, and perceptions can be misleading. What begins as ignorance plants the seed of disaster, escalating through human conflict into a tragedy of cosmic proportions.","popularity":284.3764,"poster_path":"/6VY1ZKgpsc8CfGsQcCGiYEgHdH0.jpg","release_date":"2026-07-15","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":6.771,"vote_count":643},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/ncm7djsVTHQQMX2HEbEVxMUFchG.jpg","genre_ids":[27],"id":1400837,"title":"Other Mommy","original_language":"en","original_title":"Other Mommy","overview":"Young Bela forms a relationship with a sinister entity in her home that looks uncannily like her own mother, drawing her into a terrifying and increasingly dark world.","popularity":282.4946,"poster_path":"/fGRNCssTRrhYZxNzykGGCoMsAVq.jpg","release_date":"2026-10-07","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":6.3,"vote_count":377},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/z26LxXDMmAIzKr06FPDudCJyvsM.jpg","genre_ids":[18,27,9648],"id":1813355,"title":"A Story of Derry","original_language":"en","original_title":"A Story of Derry","overview":"Hundreds of years before Pennywise, three youngsters venture into the Western Wood...where they encounter a terrifying ancient spirit.","popularity":267.7395,"poster_path":"/4PtzGcegF5Po1NmDAW9IklyvAUh.jpg","release_date":"2026-10-31","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":6.7,"vote_count":119},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/o3XwuDUj0n8qnK91p6q8LKfr6rj.jpg","genre_ids":[28,53,27],"id":1507696,"title":"Apocalypse Z: New World","original_language":"es","original_title":"Apocalipsis Z: Nuevo mundo","overview":"The Canary Islands have become Europe’s last refuge following the outbreak of the TSJ virus. When a special mission sets out for the mainland in search of vital supplies, Roberto joins the team with questionable intentions. The dangerous operation turns into a desperate race for survival, and Roberto and his companions find themselves caught between hordes of infected and divided loyalties.","popularity":250.0829,"poster_path":"/wXln4DUrwcyjcFPwgQxFPYTlG1Z.jpg","release_date":"2026-10-09","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":6.203,"vote_count":207},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/9nU0FKNefmhbgi2xXlvZchZsqwm.jpg","genre_ids":[27,53,28],"id":1244523,"title":"Beware Boiúna","original_language":"en","original_title":"Beware Boiúna","overview":"A medical mission deep in the Amazon becomes a desperate fight for survival when a colossal ancient predator awakens, turning the jungle into a deadly battleground where nature decides who lives and dies.","popularity":181.0435,"poster_path":"/7mI13sTZcuwWEIUK9fckAb8Zmba.jpg","release_date":"2026-10-01","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":6.107,"vote_count":56},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/oqrYIDH4tvfEzPe1yqT4jzmAWHQ.jpg","genre_ids":[878,27,28],"id":1381071,"title":"Godzilla Minus Zero","original_language":"ja","original_title":"ゴジラ-0.0","overview":"War reduced Japan to zero, and Godzilla plunged it into minus. Two years have passed since then, and the country has faced agonizing struggles to achieve recovery and finally reclaim its daily life. Just as humanity managed to cling to a hard-won peace, a new threat strikes, crushing hope in an instant. There is no third time. Everything ends here.","popularity":173.6675,"poster_path":"/hSmIJluOJmTWvJs4d7kHRxjc8s8.jpg","release_date":"2026-11-03","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":7.77,"vote_count":191},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/umxN2kMcUm6VoxSOdcEcQoXuC4q.jpg","genre_ids":[28,80,53],"id":1616687,"title":"Never Surrender","original_language":"id","original_title":"Serangan Balik","overview":"When a deadly gang descends on his remote home, a guilt-ridden veteran and the estranged grandchildren he barely knows must unite to survive.","popularity":150.103,"poster_path":"/hKROmLddpzpjkxKKVFYFRAOXX1b.jpg","release_date":"2026-11-11","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":7.4,"vote_count":17},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/yHVZncPRZr63mezRX20IyKLrSkv.jpg","genre_ids":[14,28,12],"id":656908,"title":"Ramayana: Rise of a Legend","original_language":"hi","original_title":"रामायणम्","overview":"An ancient epic follows a young prince and princess whose marriage and subsequent exile mark the beginning of a legendary journey. Their story of love, duty and destiny sets the stage for greater challenges ahead.","popularity":147.2321,"poster_path":"/vBQ7wks68OhJKlb3RnXSl2yXBXK.jpg","release_date":"2026-11-05","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":7.6,"vote_count":44},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/bySCyjQXNPgsnLTlgJpSMnRazPD.jpg","genre_ids":[28,53],"id":1294189,"title":"The Mongoose","original_language":"en","original_title":"The Mongoose","overview":"A falsely accused war hero with nothing to lose leads police on an epic televised cross-country car chase, helped by members of his former Special Forces Army battalion and closely monitored by a fascinated public rooting for his safe getaway.","popularity":145.1181,"poster_path":"/eSS5mvSG84UUuvtbHel5Yu3Wik4.jpg","release_